    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Extract JSON response from the AI Agent\nconst content = $('Sentiment & Data Extraction Agent').item.json.output;\n\n// Sanitize Markdown formatting (remove ```json wrappers)\nconst jsonString = content.replace(/```json|```/g, '').trim();\n\n// Parse string to JSON object\nreturn JSON.parse(jsonString);"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1104,
        352
      ],
      "id": "7de4677d-3756-4e51-96c2-edcf9b9414aa",
      "name": "Parse JSON Output"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a Sales Data Analyst for [COMPANY_NAME].\nYour task is to analyze the conversation history and extract structured data for the CRM.\n\nCONTEXT:\nLatest user message: \"{{ $json.chatInput }}\"\n\nYOUR GOAL:\nGenerate a JSON object with 4 fields:\n1. \"sentiment\": (HOT LEAD / COLD LEAD / SUPPORT / SPAM).\n   - HOT LEAD: User asks for price, offer, or provides contact info.\n   - COLD LEAD: General questions.\n2. \"phone\": (Extract phone number if present. Else null).\n3. \"name\": (Extract user name from history. Else \"Not provided\").\n4. \"interest\": (Summarize what product/model the user is interested in).\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\nReturn ONLY the raw JSON object.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        752,
        352
      ],
